   "text": "THE LABEL COMES FROM STATUTE, NOT FROM US\n\nis_delayed = (completed_on - started_on) > statutory_days\n\n3A -> 3D            365 d   NH Act 1956 s.3D(3), 3A lapses      clock_source = statute\ns.11 -> s.19        365 d   RFCTLARR 2013 s.19(7)               clock_source = statute\ns.19 -> s.23 award  365 d   RFCTLARR 2013 s.25                  clock_source = statute\naward -> disbursed   90 d   project chosen        clock_source = administrative_target\naward -> possession  90 d   project chosen        clock_source = administrative_target",
   "originalText": "THE LABEL COMES FROM STATUTE, NOT FROM US\n\nis_delayed = (completed_on - started_on) > statutory_days\n\n3A -> 3D            365 d   NH Act 1956 s.3D(3), 3A lapses      clock_source = statute\ns.11 -> s.19        365 d   RFCTLARR 2013 s.19(7)               clock_source = statute\ns.19 -> s.23 award  365 d   RFCTLARR 2013 s.25                  clock_source = statute\naward -> disbursed   90 d   project chosen        clock_source = administrative_target\naward -> possession  90 d   project chosen        clock_source = administrative_target",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 2,
