   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1756512000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "NOT A SECOND MODEL\n\npredicted_overrun_days is the empirical median overrun among\ndelayed holdout stages of the same stage and risk band,\nrendered as 'typically N days late when this happens'.\n\nA regression head is not justified at this corpus size, and an\nunlabelled point estimate would be worse than an honest median.",
   "originalText": "NOT A SECOND MODEL\n\npredicted_overrun_days is the empirical median overrun among\ndelayed holdout stages of the same stage and risk band,\nrendered as 'typically N days late when this happens'.\n\nA regression head is not justified at this corpus size, and an\nunlabelled point estimate would be worse than an honest median.",
